WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.663 --> 00:00:05.125
Something has changed, Geralt.

00:00:06.917 --> 00:00:09.200
The world's acting strange
these days.

00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:13.833
The North and South at war.

00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:19.042
Monsters roaming
when they should be hibernating.

00:00:23.509 --> 00:00:25.228
Maybe it's the end of days.

00:00:31.839 --> 00:00:34.184
I've lived through
three supposed "end of days."

00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:36.333
It's all horseshit.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:42.830
This continent
was meant for no one.

00:00:45.797 --> 00:00:47.375
None of us will have any peace…

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:51.875
until there are no monsters
left in the world.

00:00:55.022 --> 00:00:56.008
It's my home.

00:00:56.783 --> 00:00:58.033
My fight.

00:01:01.417 --> 00:01:03.708
Your precious leader's
after something.

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:08.163
You're a pawn to get to it.

00:01:10.542 --> 00:01:11.583
Rebuild our forces,

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:13.750
strengthen our numbers.

00:01:14.655 --> 00:01:15.542
We are an empire.

00:01:16.967 --> 00:01:18.175
The war's just begun.

00:01:29.625 --> 00:01:30.958
Fear is an illness

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:33.324
that can consume you.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.292
Our best chance…

00:01:40.312 --> 00:01:41.175
is to face it.

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:47.083
Are you ready for this?

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.300
If what you say
about that girl's power is true,

00:01:59.117 --> 00:02:01.000
you can't help her.

00:02:14.083 --> 00:02:16.500
Man, myth, legend.

00:02:17.958 --> 00:02:20.000
-We need your help.
-Fine.

00:02:20.083 --> 00:02:20.958
But first,

00:02:22.187 --> 00:02:23.387
gentlemen, it's been an honor.

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:26.647
What?

00:02:27.111 --> 00:02:29.125
I made new friends. Get over it.

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:30.612
Jealous.

